= What changed relative to the records
Recorded as open or proposed and read as refuted today: 103 (29 atlas, 69 idea records, 5 crypto studies); every one is listed with its reason in `TABLES.md`, and the atlas ones in `ATLAS\_DELTA.md`. Several 2026-11-10 sweep verdicts were traced to artefacts (small n, defective positive controls, noisy rho references, mis-set thresholds) and not followed. One merged idea record (`IDEA-20261109-1130d0`, anomalous sibling) is empty: $alpha equiv 0 mod (pi - 1)$ forces $N | q$, so $q$ is never prime (6,000 candidates over 20 curves, all divisible by $N$). Seven idea records carry mis-set falsifiers or predictions (`179c5d`, `410419`, `e78107`, `00e2fd`, `876571`, `fde21e`, `5114b3`); none changes a verdict, all need correction before a run.

